  "post_title": "Onda acoge una innovadora jornada de 'coaching' para profesorado",
  "post_date": "2014-03-08 11:44:15",
  "post_name": "onda-acoge-una-innovadora-jornada-de-coaching-para-profesorado",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Educación|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>La Cassola del Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda acoge todo este s&aacute;bado una innovadora jornada de &#39;coaching&#39; para profesorado, organizada por el &aacute;rea de Educaci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento y el CEFIRE.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_4765.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha introducido la jornada la directora del colegio Baltasar Rull, Pilar Manuel Arnau, en representaci&oacute;n del personal docente, a la que ha seguido la nueva directora del Centro de Formaci&oacute;n y Recursos del Profesorado (CEFIRE) de Castell&oacute;n, dependiente de la Conselleria de Educaci&oacute;n, Remei Herrero Moyano. Ha cerrado el turno de inervenciones la teniente de alcalde de Educaci&oacute;n, Cultura y Sanidad, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu Garc&iacute;a.</p>\n<p>Todas han coincidido en agradecer la implicaci&oacute;n y el inter&eacute;s de las m&aacute;s de cien personas asistentes para aprender nuevas herramientas que permitan trabajar en la educaci&oacute;n, &quot;cada vez m&aacute;s complicada y dif&iacute;cil a causa de los recortes por la crisis econ&oacute;mica&quot;, seg&uacute;n ha dicho Pilar Manuel. Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu ha destacado que ese inter&eacute;s es compartido por el Ayuntamiento y por la adminstraci&oacute;n auton&oacute;mica, representada por el CEFIRE, &quot;como lo demuestra esta jornada!</p>\n<p>A continuaci&oacute;n ha entrado ya en materia la prestigiosa coach Simonetta Carta, primero con la conferencia &#39;Coaching&#39; para el profesorado y despu&eacute;s sobre C&oacute;mo conseguir lo mejor de tu mism@ y de tu alumnado, para cerrar la sesi&oacute;n matinal.</p>\n<p>Para la tarde est&aacute; prevista la presentaci&oacute;n de buenas pr&aacute;cticas y la aplicaci&oacute;n en el aula de las t&eacute;cnicas de &#39;coaching&#39;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4761.jpg\" alt=\"img_4761\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4762.jpg\" alt=\"img_4762\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4763.jpg\" alt=\"img_4763\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4764.jpg\" alt=\"img_4764\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4765.jpg\" alt=\"img_4765\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4766.jpg\" alt=\"img_4766\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4767.jpg\" alt=\"img_4767\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4768.jpg\" alt=\"img_4768\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4769.jpg\" alt=\"img_4769\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4770.jpg\" alt=\"img_4770\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4771.jpg\" alt=\"img_4771\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4772.jpg\" alt=\"img_4772\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4773.jpg\" alt=\"img_4773\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4774.jpg\" alt=\"img_4774\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4775.jpg\" alt=\"img_4775\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4776.jpg\" alt=\"img_4776\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4778.jpg\" alt=\"img_4778\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4781.jpg\" alt=\"img_4781\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4783.jpg\" alt=\"img_4783\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugjornadacoachingprofessorat/img_4784.jpg\" alt=\"img_4784\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
